<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dayton Hudson upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dayton Hudson upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs and Dean Witter raised their recommendations on Dayton Hudson Corp, according to sources at each firm.</p>
<p>-- Goldman changed its opinion to market outperform from market perform while Dean Witter lifted Dayton Hudson to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- In the first minutes of NYSE trade, the stock rose to a new all-time high 39 with a 1-3/8 gain.</p>
</text>
